msgid ""
"Where controller and hardware-interface parameters live, how to inspect "
"them, and how this stack treats **startup vs runtime** changes. Per-"
"parameter tables: [Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md) and "
"[Hardware interface "
"parameters](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"控制器与硬件接口参数写在哪里、如何查看，以及本栈如何区分**启动时 vs 运行时**变更。逐参数表：[控制器 ROS 2 参数](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md) 与 [硬件接口参数](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)。"

